    <string name="manual_msg">Huawei doesn\'t let apps open this screen directly, so do this:\n\n1. Settings → Apps → Launch manager.\n\n2. Find ZeroTune in the list and tap it.\n\n3. Turn off the automatic management switch (the top one).\n\n4. Three switches will appear: auto-launch, secondary launch and run in background. All three must be on.\n\nOn older EMUI versions this screen is called \"App launch\" and is in Settings → Battery.</string>
