    <string name="about_version">ZeroTune · version %1$s · Xray</string>
    <string name="about_desc">ZeroTune is a lightweight VPN client built on the Xray core (VLESS, Reality, Vision). Made primarily for Huawei and Honor: background stability, a quick-settings tile, per-app and per-site routing, MTU setting, speed and ping.</string>
    <string name="about_credits">Uses the open-source projects Xray-core and hev-socks5-tunnel.</string>
    <string name="about_author">Created by %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_author_text">Made for convenience: most VPN clients have a huge number of settings nobody uses. Here only the essential basics are collected — and nothing more is needed.</string>
    <string name="about_ai">This app was made with the help of AI (Claude by Anthropic): the code was written in a conversation with a neural network and tested on real devices.</string>

